{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おととい親知らずを抜きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山﨑怜奈ですo(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/01/25/9869535/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週末、センター試験を受けました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログや755への本当に沢山の応援メッセージ、お手紙、などなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございましたm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに心強いことは無かった(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ受験者のみなさんも、まずは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひと段落ついたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れさまでした～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、現役高校生アイドルで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センター試験まともに受けるのって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しいのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という疑問を、755にも投げかけてみたけど、どうなんでしょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何にせよ、無事に大きな山を越えられて、ホッとしています..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い人生経験でしたo(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸能界に身を置かせていただいている人間として、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年まではただエールを送ることしか出来なかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年からは気持ちも理解できるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その点でも、受けて良かったです～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじめか(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなザキさんは、当日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠気覚し用のミントタブレットと間違えて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋のヒーターの薄型リモコンを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カバンに入れてきてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり...まじめというかなんというか...どんくさいというか...んー( ¯•ω•¯ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうそう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日ふと思い立ち、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つかの間の勉強休憩も兼ねて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然カップケーキを焼きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/01/25/9869535/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急だったので材料の在庫が少なく、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"計10個。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたま近くにいたメンバーに配りました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ココアと抹茶の二種類、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上に乗っているのはアーモンド！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、ここで【クイズ】（＾_＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この二種類のマフィンには、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれ別の「隠し味」が入っていますが、何と何でしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ両方当たったら凄いなーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ココア味には〇〇、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抹茶味には〇〇が入ってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という感じで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ回答してね＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの回答をみて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまりにも難しそうだったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメでこっそり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒントを出そうかな～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/01/25/9869535/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【お知らせ】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎2/10発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌『MARQUEE』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初MARQUEEさん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後さんの連載など、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎号かかさず見ているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回お仕事できて嬉しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめかさん 花奈さん らりんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世 未央奈 わたし の6人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブの話や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんの卒業や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの抱負など..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今しか話せないこと、今話すべきこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を沢山語ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎755というアプリでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方やメンバーとトークしたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動画をたくさん載せています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://7gogo.jp/yamazaki-rena"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/01/25/9869535/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事帰りに母と合流して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯を食べたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で着る服を買いました(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月の京都の握手会で着ます(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、1/30の5部と、2/28の4部が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完売しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その反面、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14thの握手会から部数が減って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほとんどの会場で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部制になってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部の遅い時間は来れない方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山いると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"研究生のとき、誰も来ないレーンの中で一人ぼっちで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく心細かったことを思い出します"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあの景色を見るかもしれない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思うと不安です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、限られた時間ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみたいと思いますo(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/b